answer_vi:
**Circuit Breaker** bảo vệ service khỏi cascade failure khi downstream chậm/lỗi. **3 trạng thái:** CLOSED (bình thường, pass through) → OPEN (lỗi nhiều, fail-fast) → HALF_OPEN (thử vài request kiểm tra recovery). Dùng `resilience4j-spring-boot3`.

```yaml
resilience4j.circuitbreaker.instances.payment-service:
  slidingWindowSize: 10
  failureRateThreshold: 50       # >50% fail → OPEN
  waitDurationInOpenState: 30s
  permittedCallsInHalfOpenState: 3
```

```java
@CircuitBreaker(name = "payment-service", fallbackMethod = "paymentFallback")
@Retry(name = "payment-service")
public PaymentResult charge(Long orderId, BigDecimal amount) { ... }

private PaymentResult paymentFallback(Long orderId, BigDecimal amount, Exception ex) {
  pendingOrderQueue.add(orderId);        // fallback khi OPEN
  return PaymentResult.pending(orderId);
}
```

**Kết hợp:** **Retry** (thử lại trước khi báo lỗi), **Bulkhead** (giới hạn concurrent call), **TimeLimiter** (timeout async). Xem state qua `/actuator/circuitbreakers`.

answer_en:
**Circuit Breaker** protects a service from cascade failure when a downstream is slow/unavailable. **3 states:** CLOSED (normal, pass through) → OPEN (too many failures, fail-fast) → HALF_OPEN (tries a few requests to check recovery). Use `resilience4j-spring-boot3`.

```yaml
resilience4j.circuitbreaker.instances.payment-service:
  slidingWindowSize: 10
  failureRateThreshold: 50       # >50% fail → OPEN
  waitDurationInOpenState: 30s
  permittedCallsInHalfOpenState: 3
```

```java
@CircuitBreaker(name = "payment-service", fallbackMethod = "paymentFallback")
@Retry(name = "payment-service")
public PaymentResult charge(Long orderId, BigDecimal amount) { ... }

private PaymentResult paymentFallback(Long orderId, BigDecimal amount, Exception ex) {
  pendingOrderQueue.add(orderId);        // fallback when OPEN
  return PaymentResult.pending(orderId);
}
```

**Combine with:** **Retry** (retry before failing), **Bulkhead** (limit concurrent calls), **TimeLimiter** (async timeout). Inspect state via `/actuator/circuitbreakers`
